Third-party model licenses
==========================

This stack downloads and runs the following models. Each is governed by its
own license — review them before any production or commercial use:

  - Qwen3-TTS (Base / VoiceDesign / CustomVoice)
      https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base
      https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign
      https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice

  - Qwen3-ASR
      https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B

  - ACE-Step (music generation)
      https://github.com/ACE-Step/ACE-Step-1.5

  - MMAudio (sound-effect generation)
      https://github.com/hkchengrex/MMAudio

Vocarium itself bundles no model weights. Models are pulled at install time
into a local cache directory.
